{"groups":[{"members":["c1"],"primary":"c1","title":"Boston Fair Chance Tenant Selection Policy (DND)","requirement":"Covered housing providers must assess applicants case by case and may not use blanket criminal-record bans. When deciding eligibility or eviction, they may not consider non-conviction arrests, convictions subject to judicial relief (expunged or sealed), juvenile records, or convictions more than 5 years old. They also may not use credit scores, and may use credit history only in lieu of unavailable rental history.","key_value":"Excludes non-conviction arrests, expunged or sealed convictions, juvenile records and convictions over 5 years old; no use of credit score","status":"in_force","effective_date":null,"end_date":null,"citation":"Boston Fair Chance Tenant Selection Policy (DND, February 2017)","coverage_conditions":"Housing providers receiving DND funding and/or land, or with income-restricted units created under the BPDA Inclusionary Development Policy. Also applied to the Office of Fair Housing and Equity Affirmative Marketing Program.","exemptions":"Criminal-history limits do not apply where a conviction directly relates to the housing sought, where there is unreasonable risk of substantial harm to others' safety, or to current criminal behavior. Conflicting federal or state criminal-history requirements take precedence over the policy.","coverage_from":"c1","conflict_note":null},{"members":["c2"],"primary":"c2","title":"Boston Fair Housing Regulations: rental assistance / voucher protection","requirement":"In Boston, landlords may not discriminate against renters who use rental assistance, including Section 8, social security disability and veterans vouchers. Telling an applicant that rental assistance is not accepted is housing discrimination.","key_value":"Refusing rental assistance or vouchers is prohibited","status":"in_force","effective_date":null,"end_date":null,"citation":"Boston Fair Housing Regulations","coverage_conditions":"Rentals, sales and housing financing within the City of Boston. No building-based coverage conditions are stated.","exemptions":null,"coverage_from":"c2","conflict_note":null}],"dropped":[]}
